<title>USA: Millicom ups subscribers 101 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Millicom ups subscribers 101 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millicom International Cellular SA said Tuesday that it added 85,474 subscribers in the fourth quarter, ending the 1996 fiscal year with 504,440 subscribers, a 101 percent increase.</p>
<p>The 1996 fiscal year ended December 31.</p>
<p>Millicom is a cellular telephone operator.</p>
